{"exps":[{"para":{"tag":"tag_1"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"layer":"chara2"},"key":"top"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_2"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"alpha":0,"scaleX":1,"layer":"chara2","img":"chara049_1","scaleY":1,"mirrow":false,"x":50,"trans":false,"y":-350,"noOut":false,"bright":1,"addImg":"chara049_1_face_chara049_1a","noIn":false},"key":"setLayer"},{"para":{"alpha":1,"scaleX":1,"layer":"chara2","img":"chara049_1","scaleY":1,"mirrow":false,"x":50,"transTime":0,"trans":false,"y":-350,"noOut":false,"bright":1,"addImg":"chara049_1_face_chara049_1a","nonStandBright":false,"noIn":false,"timeBak":300},"key":"moveLayer"},{"para":{"nameSide":"left","charaName":"菲莉娜","text":"[show]早！你们起的真早啊。[l][cm]"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_3"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"nameSide":"left","charaName":"菲莉娜","text":"[show]我还以为我起得够早了，没想到居然也没比你们早上多少啊！[l][cm]"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_4"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"nameSide":"left","charaName":"菲莉娜","text":"[show]一大清早就要开始工作了吗？工匠这一行也太辛苦了吧！[l][cm]"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_5"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"nameSide":"left","charaName":"菲莉娜","text":"[show]像我们猎人，绝大多数时候都是在埋伏和等待，那种时候根本就和休息没两样嘛！[l][cm]"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_6"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"layer":"chara2","img":"chara049_1_face_chara049_1b"},"key":"setLayerFace"},{"para":{"nameSide":"left","charaName":"菲莉娜","text":"[show]我说，你真的没什么事情需要我帮忙吗？我来这边是度假来的，时间可是一抓一大把呢。[l][cm]"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_7"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"layer":"chara2","img":"chara049_1_face_chara049_1a"},"key":"setLayerFace"},{"para":{"nameSide":"left","charaName":"菲莉娜","text":"[show]让好妹妹一个人工作，我就在这干看着，那不是太不讲义气了吗？[l][cm]"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_8"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"nameSide":"left","charaName":"菲莉娜","text":"[show]所以你是真的不需要我帮忙吗？[l][cm]"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_9"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"nameSide":"left","charaName":"菲莉娜","text":"[show]好吧，既然你这么坚持，那我就不帮了，但是在这陪着你，你应该不反对吧？[l][cm]"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_10"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"nameSide":"left","charaName":"菲莉娜","text":"[show]等你忙完之后，我们再一起去打猎好了。[l][cm]"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_11"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"nameSide":"left","charaName":"菲莉娜","text":"[show]晚饭想吃什么你可以事先想好，无论什么我都能给你打回来。[l][cm]"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_12"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"layer":"chara2","img":"chara049_1_face_chara049_1e"},"key":"setLayerFace"},{"para":{"nameSide":"left","charaName":"菲莉娜","text":"[show]哈哈，这可不是在说大话！所有契约者都知道的，菲莉娜的箭，可是例无虚发啊！[l][cm]"},"key":"text"}],"script":"sj_049_03","des":"菲莉娜-菲莉娜，早啊。"}